    "detailed_description": "Your goal is simple. <br />\r\nTake the elevator to floor 6.<br />\r\nBut this is no ordinary elevator...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWho knows where you'll end up. <br />\r\nA hotel, dungeon, hedge maze, a train?<br />\r\nYou must travel from floor 1 to 6, working out if each floor is valid or not.<br />\r\nIf a floor is not valid, you must press the emergency button and don't continue up, or you have to start all over again!<br />\r\nHow do you know if a floor is valid?<br />\r\nEach floor has a numerical clue to indicate what number it is. If this doesn't match the number on the elevator, the floor in not valid.<br />\r\nThese clues could be a written number on the wall or the number of objects in a pile, but they are often not so simple.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry and try again to reach floor 6, exploring and learning about each floors clues, in order to get the perfect run!<br />\r\nEach run is random, with 24 possible floors to arrive at.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA marathon mode is included, as the ultimate test, making you go through all 24 possible floors to reach the end.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you tackle the Elevator Warp?",
    "about_the_game": "Your goal is simple. <br />\r\nTake the elevator to floor 6.<br />\r\nBut this is no ordinary elevator...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWho knows where you'll end up. <br />\r\nA hotel, dungeon, hedge maze, a train?<br />\r\nYou must travel from floor 1 to 6, working out if each floor is valid or not.<br />\r\nIf a floor is not valid, you must press the emergency button and don't continue up, or you have to start all over again!<br />\r\nHow do you know if a floor is valid?<br />\r\nEach floor has a numerical clue to indicate what number it is. If this doesn't match the number on the elevator, the floor in not valid.<br />\r\nThese clues could be a written number on the wall or the number of objects in a pile, but they are often not so simple.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry and try again to reach floor 6, exploring and learning about each floors clues, in order to get the perfect run!<br />\r\nEach run is random, with 24 possible floors to arrive at.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA marathon mode is included, as the ultimate test, making you go through all 24 possible floors to reach the end.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you tackle the Elevator Warp?",
    "short_description": "Your goal is simple. Take the elevator to floor 6. But this is no ordinary elevator... Who knows which random floor you'll end up at. A hotel, dungeon, hedge maze, a train? Check the clues on each floor to be able to progress, and achieve the perfect run!",
